  "body": "## What's Changed\n* feat(polymarket): lead entity topics with their most interesting markets by @mvanhorn in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1487\n* fix(polymarket): match descriptive topics across simple plurals by @mvanhorn in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1492\n* fix(polymarket): report partial searches and bound them by the stream deadline by @mvanhorn in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1493\n* test(planner): pin drill plans keeping polymarket_hints; share one hint cap by @mvanhorn in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1494\n* fix(jobs): find secret job signals on company runs by @mvanhorn in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1491\n* chore(release): bump version to 4.3.0 by @github-actions[bot] in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1496\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/compare/v4.2.1...v4.3.0",
